Screw this, Shigeru! What's the ETA for reinforcements?

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.870
[gibberish]

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.420
What the hell is going on here?!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.040
We have to get them out of there now!

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:35.660
Run away!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:36.420
[gibberish]

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:40.430
Shut up! Shinji, I know I told you you don't have
to run away anymore, but we need you to--

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.820
YYAAAAAAHHH!!!!

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:43.890
Oh fuck everything!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.310
The Eva's power cable's been cut!

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:47.050
You have 30 seconds of operational time left.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:48.390
Okay, nobody panic!

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:49.810
We're all going to die!

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:50.430
20 seconds.

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:51.390
AAAAAHHHH!!!!

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.730
Hey, new kid, you mind if I take a leak in here?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.110
AAAAAAAHHHHH!!!!!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:55.990
15 seconds!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.700
Humanity is dying and all I can think about is how I don't give a fuck.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.530
80 seconds!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.030
You need to take charge of everyone.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.620
Can you get off my ass for one second?!

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.160
Negative 47 seconds!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:06.500
Can someone please tell me what's going on?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.230
I have a boner.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.160
10 seconds remaining.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.050
10 seconds??

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:09.710
10,

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:10.490
9,

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.710
Everyone, shut up for a second!

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:12.720
7,

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.170
Can we all just calm down?!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:15.340
5,

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.960
Why is nobody listening to me?!

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:17.940
AAAHHHH!!!!

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.640
3, 2, 1!

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.510
Angel destroyed...

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:28.230
Everyone ready your battle stations!

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:31.810
Fuyutsuki, fetch me my victory sandwich!
I finally know what an Angel is!

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:34.050
What'd I miss?

